{"id": "unknown-2026-11-19-009", "date": "2026-11-19", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Tesla seeks Texas tax break for $3.1 billion polysilicon plant", "content": "<p>Tesla says it will build a polysilicon plant in Texas only if the state cuts its property tax bill, as it seeks to produce solar’s most China-dominated material at home.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/19/tesla-seeks-texas-tax-break-for-3-1-billion-polysilicon-plant/\">Tesla seeks Texas tax break for $3.1 billion polysilicon plant</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/19/tesla-seeks-texas-tax-break-for-3-1-billion-polysilicon-plant/", "type": "rss"}]}
